Spoilers....



(1) Hack around patiently until you get a scroll of teleportation.
    Get confused and read it in one of the maze levels.  The Medusa
    and Castle levels are un-teleportible (?) but I believe the levels
    in-between are not (although I'm not sure).  You may end up above
    Medusa level.

(2) Freeze the water with a wand of cold.

(3) There ARE wishes inside the Castle.  I think if you got that far,
    you shouldn't have so much trouble killing them....but if you
    aren't, try hacking them away one at a time....first kill all the
    xorns that wander out, then zap a wand of striking at the
    drawbridge (#), and kill all the flying creatures.  Retracting
    into the mini-maze of the left side to take them one by one is a
    good idea.  By that time you're done, one of the giants inside
    should have thrown you a border, so push it into the square next
    to the original drawbridge, stand on it and take the rest.  You'll
    find a WoW somewhere inside the Castle.

